## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run the server & Web UI

```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Open [http://127.0.0.1:8000](http://127.0.0.1:8000) in your browser.

## Run tests

```bash
pytest
```

